{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33175","headline":"沧浪峡 · 司马扎","name":"沧浪峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山下水声深，水边山色聚。\n月照秋自清，花名春不去。\n似非人间境，又近红尘路。\n乍入洞中天，更移云外步。\n我殊惺惺者，犹得沧浪趣。\n可以濯吾缨，斯言诚所慕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}